[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Defend</h2>
<i>"WAKE UP!"<br>
--Yelth Dorn (after sneaking his entire army ,past sleeping guards, on to an enemy island)</i>  
<p>The leader of one of the larger clans left, the Lord Chamberland of Thunder, has decided to take the Isle of Geysers for himself.  He and his generals has gather a sizeable amount of storm power and have begun their attack.  Defend the Isle of Geysers and crush your foe; perhaps his followers may follow you after you defeat him...

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You have defeated the Lord Chamberland of Thunder!  The final battle approaches as the remaining clans gather and engage in combat.  The some followers of the Lord Chamberland have vowed revenge, but due to their losses they will not likely attack you.  You will not be able to run from this battle if you wish to rule nimbus.
<p>
~lDo you wish to continue on?

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=~iTO BATTLE!!,MissionBegin,tnron71
$Button=~rNo,Tell,TryAgain

