<p>
The Chamberland's forces pressed on with there attack after the Page's defeat.  Unable to stop the attacks you lost the Isle of Geysers.  The Chamberland continued his attack untill he was crowned the new ruler of Nimbus.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


